      2 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نِخّت لِفُلَانٍ</span></b> , as also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سخّت لَهُ</span>, <i>He went to
the utmost length</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">استقصى</span>) <i>in speaking to such a
one.</i> So in the Nawádir. (Az, L.) [Accord.
to the K, ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَخَتَ</span></b> , inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَخْتٌ</span>.]

